  "ready_definition": "Draft production-core data collection and measurement inputs are callable and measurable under the current incremental operating policy. Store is the preferred runtime entrypoint, not an exclusive boundary: when required real observations or lookback windows are absent, targeted Git history lookup and authorized direct-source recovery may be used with provenance and QC. READY does not declare the downstream Permission engine, trading model, scheduler/Store SLA, or repository-wide runtime production release."
